WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.912
Scale of infrastructure failure.

00:00:02.862 --> 00:00:08.800
Canada's infrastructure deficit is estimated at over 150 billion dollars.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:15.287
Bridges, roads, water systems, and public transit deteriorate while spending goes elsewhere.
